    {
      "_id": "h341mdOOsriKWjeI",
      "_key": "!actors.items!ehOrFFpbSWwgBCOD.h341mdOOsriKWjeI",
      "name": "Dark Pulse (Legendary Action)",
      "img": "icons/magic/lightning/orb-ball-spiral-blue.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "sort": 700,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {},
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>Legendary Action Uses: 3. Immediately after another creature's turn, the shahoko can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The shahoko regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns. When the shahoko takes aim with a Legendary Action, the point it targets glows with faint but noticeable magic until the effect occurs.</em></p><p>The shahoko takes aim at a point within 60 feet of it. At the end of the next enemy's turn, a blast of necrotic energy fills a 20-foot-radius Sphere centred on that point. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 17 Constitution, each creature in the area. <em>Failure:</em> 13 (3d8) Necrotic damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage. <em>Success or Failure:</em> The area is filled with magical darkness until the end of the shahoko's next turn.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "type": {
          "value": "monster",
          "subtype": ""
        },
        "activation": {
          "type": "legendary",
          "cost": 1,
          "condition": ""
        },
        "requirements": "",
        "uses": {
          "spent": 0,
          "recovery": []
        },
        "activities": {}
      }
    },
