      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The shahoko takes aim at a point within 60 feet of it. At the end of the next enemy's turn, an elemental explosion fills a 30-foot-radius Sphere centred on that point. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 17 Dexterity, each creature in the area. <em>Failure:</em> 14 (4d6) Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Poison damage (shahoko's choice when it takes this action). <em>Success:</em> Half damage.</p>",
